        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_03a",
      "hash64": "ADA252915EEB8A25",
      "text": "那真是太好了啊，\\n你看起来很开心，我真高兴啊。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_03b",
      "hash64": "ADA24F915EEB850C",
      "text": "相信今后一定会\\n变得越来越快乐的。\\r\\n要是有什么烦恼，我们一起想办法～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_04",
      "hash64": "33860770BD20EDBF",
      "text": "对了！你在使用\\n宝可梦图鉴App吗？[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_05",
      "hash64": "33860670BD20EC0C",
      "text": "其实，开发它的人，\\n嘿嘿……就是我啦。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_06",
      "hash64": "33860970BD20F125",
      "text": "只要大家捉到宝可梦，\\n数据就会传送到我这里，\\r\\n从而帮助宝可梦的调查不断进展～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_07",
      "hash64": "33860870BD20EF72",
      "text": "所以你要是发现了没见过的宝可梦，\\n就试着捕捉它来填入图鉴吧。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_08",
      "hash64": "33860B70BD20F48B",
      "text": "首个目标，收集３０种宝可梦～！[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_09",
      "hash64": "33860A70BD20F2D8",
      "text": "收集好以后，就来告诉我一声吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
